Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:36.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The reason why you hate me so much is cuz\NI dropped a washtub on your head, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:39.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have no intent\Non being chummy with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I don't feel like\Nbeing enemies, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I went a bit too far that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:46.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:51.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Apologize to Okarun since\Nyou made fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:56.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then we'll call it even, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:01.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You really don't get it at all, Momo Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:06.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call you my sworn enemy\Nbecause of a washtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm after you because I'm positive\Nthat you're a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:17.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you that I wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:20.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're nothing but trouble if you poke at me\Nbecause of a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then what the hell is he!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:28.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun fighting Acrobatic Silky\Nlooked just like a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:30.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:33.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way she's your grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:35.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's too pretty and way too young!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:37.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:39.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's a really good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:40.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, Momo is a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.99,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You shut up, old hag!\NYou're complicating things!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.33,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun and Auntie are demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And you're the big boss in charge of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:54.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're trying to destroy the world, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:59.22,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,ARE YOU A TOTAL IDIOT!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:00.72,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,IF I HAD SUCH POWERS, I'D START OFF
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:02.43,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BY BLOWING YOUR HEAD OFF!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.35,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,DON'T GO DAYDREAMING\NLIKE SOME EIGHTH GRADER!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.85,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BLOW MY HEAD OFF?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:11.69,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BLOW MY HEAD OFF?\NNOW YOU'RE SHOWING YOUR TRUE COLORS!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:14.19,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BLOW MY HEAD OFF?\NNOW YOU'RE SHOWING YOUR TRUE COLORS!\NRIGHT NOW, I DON'T HAVE\NENOUGH POWER TO BEAT YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.74,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BUT I'M SURE I'LL BECOME STRONGER\NAND BEAT YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.45,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SOUNDS GREAT! TRY ME IF YOU CAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.53,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SOUNDS GREAT! TRY ME IF YOU CAN!\NI'LL BEAT YOU TO A PULP!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.33,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SOUNDS LIKE YOU UNDERESTIMATE ME,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.75,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SOUNDS LIKE YOU UNDERESTIMATE ME,\NBUT YOU'RE FORGETTING ONE THING.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:31.04,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SOUNDS LIKE YOU UNDERESTIMATE ME,\NBUT YOU'RE FORGETTING ONE THING.\NI HAVE BEEN CHOSEN\NTO PROTECT WORLD PEACE!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I'm just too cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The somen noodles were tasty, Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:39.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:45.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Keep trying hard, Aira.\NBlow Momo away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:48.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Auntie here is cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:51.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it, you old hag!\NWhy are you rooting for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:52.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:03:01.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Despite being a demon,\Nyou tried to save me multiple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:04.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's because he's not a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:11.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:14.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If someone's in trouble,\Nyou'd help them, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:18.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:22.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You still have a human heart left in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:26.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will make sure to liberate you\Nfrom Momo Ayase's control!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:38.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's got a tremendous misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's something\Nseriously wrong with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This feeling is so wrong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:49.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a human, and he's a demon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's wrong!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can't you do this a bit more normally!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Quit your whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:32.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm putting yer ball back in for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's play a tight game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:38.48,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,THE POWER OF NESSIE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:41.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- And why're you trying to bat?\N- Pitcher's jittery! Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jittery? Who're ya talkin' to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When you see my Turbo Granny Ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:54.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,you won't be spoutin' such nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Such cheeky talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:10.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike! Batter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When a ball strikes your nuts,\Nya gotta jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:18.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So? Is it back in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:20.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:23.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have one ball back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hurray!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That pitch was high and inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll hit it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Smokin' ball, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:34.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Good for you, Okarun.\NYou got a testicle back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:41.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We have no clues for the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:45.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you don't have a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can't you look at occult forums\Nor something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Guess I'll add more part-time jobs\Nand buy a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:56.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A four-year loan is a serious rip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:58.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I'll see you at the roof during lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:04.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm sorry, Miss Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd like to work on a report during lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:12.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wanna head to an internet café\Nafter school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:18.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I also have\Nsomething after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:24.79,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,I'VE GOT THIS FUNNY FEELING
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.00,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 8\NI'VE GOT THIS FUNNY FEELING
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:30.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's eat together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Okarun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He said he's working on a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So noble! Maybe I'll have him\Nwork on mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun is so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But it's kinda suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:48.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's like totally obvious\Nthat he's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A scent of a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:52.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:57.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun's the last person\NI'd suspect that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:01.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nah. It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:04.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go buy a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:07.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then can you get me one, too?\NA Pompy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.59,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,POMPY ORANGE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:21.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel so uneasy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:25.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I peek into Class C?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I don't want to bother him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's writing a report after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:57.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fourteen... Fifteen... Sixteen...\NSeventeen... Eighteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nineteen... Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:05.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm no good like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As I look for my golden ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:14.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure another dangerous monster\Nwill show up, and I'll have to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:22.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Push-ups, sit-ups,\Nback extensions, and squats.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:25.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five sets, 100 reps each.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:28.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to become strong.\NA lot stronger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:33.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I don't, I'll be putting\NMiss Ayase in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:35.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:40.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,D-Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:50.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a demon, and I'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:53.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I know that it will never be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not a demon, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't hold back how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun! You just stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:02.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Huh? What the...\N- Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.45,0:10:03.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Just close your eyes.\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:14.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:17.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you dodging me?\NYou're so weird, Takakura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:18.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the weird one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would you do that out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:25.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, when you confess your love,\Nyou have to kiss that person, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:26.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:27.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It said so in a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.10,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,WEEKLY TRUE ACCOUNTS\NFULL NUDE PHOTOS "JUNGLE SPRING"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:30.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That confessing equals a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:34.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And that it's the responsibility\Nof the guy to accept that confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What did you use as your reference?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.70,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,ROMANCE MANUAL\NVOL.8 (R-18)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was the one in Dad's study!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:43.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's something completely different!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:47.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori, you're totally popular\Nwith all the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:49.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you acting like\Nyou're an amateur in relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:51.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- You like mature lips?\N- I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you stop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:56.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A popular girl\Nshouldn't be doing something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:59.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't equate popularity and romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't know the effort\Nbehind popularity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I'm not an amateur in relationships!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I just don't know about them!\NDon't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's exactly who the phrase describes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:11.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And right now,\Nyou've got every last thing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:15.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never felt this way before.\NLet me confess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A-Are you insane!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:20.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Or are you possessed\Nby something again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:22.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, Miss Shiratori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:02.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, wait. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:05.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why you little turd...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase! You got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is nothing like what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:16.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said you were going to work on a report,\Nbut you're making out with that damn girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You took your jacket off\Nand you're even sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:20.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that on your arms?\NPart of your kinky play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have reasons for all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:27.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Was the report thing a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Th-That was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:32.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But there's a reason for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:35.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said, I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.24,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,POMPY ORANGE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's my Pompy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:46.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I gave it to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:48.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that? A new gag?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They didn't have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:55.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hold on. I'm thinking right now.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:13:00.17,BD Top Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,STRIKING QUICKLY WITH RAPTORIAL LIMBS,\NIT BREAKS CLAMS TO EAT.\NDURING TERRITORIAL BATTLES AGAINST\NOTHER MANTIS SHRIMP\NIS WHEN THEY ALSO UNLEASH PUNCHES.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:58.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A mantis shrimp's punches\Nclock at 80 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:01.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It has the force of roughly 150 kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:04.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you scale it to human size,\Nit's roughly 700 tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can defeat elephants with such a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:09.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's this effective underwater\Nwith all that resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How destructive do you think it'd be\Nif it was unleashed in air?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, that's still an unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.98,0:13:21.03,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because a mantis shrimp is thought\Nto hold back on its punches while in air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:24.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see, I see. You too have times when\Nyou simply want to punch something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:25.74,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps the mantis shrimp realizes that\Nbecause its punches have too much force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She just talked to a mantis shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:29.83,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Unleashing one in the air may injure\Nits joints at best, and burst its arm at worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's got it pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:42.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:45.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's been possessed\Nby the spirit of a mantis shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase is right about this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's pointless to make excuses.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:55.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'd gotten stronger without\Nher knowing, I thought it'd be kinda cool.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I even made an effort to lie.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've sown the seeds myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I care about Miss Ayase,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shouldn't make excuses,\Nand just get stronger!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:23.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Is anyone here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:28.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:31.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori, where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:36.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's pitch black outside the window.\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can this be Momo Ayase's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come to think, where's Miss Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:45.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:47.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:53.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This feeling... I've experienced\Nsomething similar in the past.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:00.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it. I'm completely locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This seriously sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The water level is rising, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Or is this only happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:15.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh! When I think about him,\NI get so pissed off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:17.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's up with this water, anyway!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Something's totally approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:03.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is that? A dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:54.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh! Is Okarun not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:01.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NBut it sounded like an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:04.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, what exactly\Nis this situation we're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:07.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you and Momo Ayase\Ntrying to frame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:10.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course not.\NI'd like to ask what's going on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:14.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But something similar to this\Nhappened in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:19.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It was pitch black outside,\Nand we were completely walled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:21.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What did you do back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:25.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, when we defeated the alien,\Nit went back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:26.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:30.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a second. Aliens exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,To be honest, they're even worse\Nthan yokai monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Then why do aliens assault us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:43.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It seems like they're collecting\Nhuman reproductive organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:51.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita, you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:55.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chiquitita-chi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:58.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita. Chiquitita, you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:01.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:05.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.\NSh-Shy my chotchiki for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.16,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This makes me wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:08.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chi-Chiquitita-chi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.54,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, what a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:10.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.\NChiquitita, you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:14.84,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to protect a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chi-Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chi-Chi-Chiquitita.\NChi-Chi-Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sh-Shy my chotchiki for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, ah, west and east.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:20.72,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira-chan. You're in the way, so get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:22.34,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"A-Aira-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:24.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, ah, north and south.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.18,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We haven't even kissed yet.\NDon't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:28.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, ah, morning, noon, and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.02,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel so droopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:32.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're gig workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:38.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:44.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We finally meet, man person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:47.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Serpoians.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:49.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:55.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori, run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.21,0:19:58.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,These guys target women!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:03.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:09.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We adjusted this void space so that\Nonly those with high spirituality can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is the apparatus malfunctioning?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:15.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We came here because\Nwe just want your banana organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:17.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:18.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:19.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:23.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why is everything after my junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:25.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because it's something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:31.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have an amazing power\Nthat surpasses our scientific technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:34.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We want your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We'd love to experiment on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...and transplant your abilities to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the power of a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:45.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not my own abilities\Nor anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:49.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I personally have less physical power\Nthan the average person!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:54.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Curse? What kind of\Nbanana organ condition is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:55.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I'd know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:59.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it. I can't transform at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:03.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like when Miss Ayase is holding back\Nthe curse with her psychic powers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then let's get to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...and perform the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:22.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,First, let us cut off the banana organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:24.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:28.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I still only have one testicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:45.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It seems that\NI am the chosen one after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:56.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go of Takakura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:29.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm human, and he's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:32.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I know it's wrong,\Nbut I can't hold these feelings back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:36.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm going to save Takakura-sama from the hands\Nof the evil boss demon, Momo Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:37.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.10,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 9\NMERGE! SERPO DOVER DEMON NESSIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"Merge! Serpo Dover Demon Nessie!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:41.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
